  "title": {
   "rendered": "Here We Shrink Again &#8211; Winter 2026 &#8211; Part 1"
  },
  "content": {
   "rendered": "<p>We kick off the new year with some more products that were downsized over the past six months or so. Shrinkflation is alive and well and will continue in 2026.</p>\n<table>\n<th bgcolor=#E0E1CD>\n<font  size=\"+2\" color=#000000>Viva Paper Towels</font>\n</th>\n</table>\n<p>Like other brands of paper towels, Viva shortened their rolls last year, going from 94 sheets on the old double rolls to just 86 sheets.  Thanks to Richard  G. for this submission.</p>\n<p><font color=red>*Mouse Print:</font></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://www.mouseprint.org/wp-content/avert/viva-84-86mp.jpg\" alt=\"Viva 94-86\" width=\"700\" height=\"315\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-24007\" srcset=\"https://www.mouseprint.org/wp-content/avert/viva-84-86mp.jpg 700w, https://www.mouseprint.org/wp-content/avert/viva-84-86mp-300x135.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px\" /></p>\n<hr>\n<table>\n<th bgcolor=#E0E1CD>\n<font  size=\"+2\" color=#000000>Mary&#8217;s Gone Crackers</font>\n</th>\n</table>\n<p>Gregg Z. was very unhappy to see that his favorite crackers that he has been eating for 17 years was hit by shrinkflation. It survived in its original size until the current owner recently reduced the contents by over 25%.</p>\n<p><font color=red>*Mouse Print:</font></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://www.mouseprint.org/wp-content/avert/marys-gone-crackers.jpg\" alt=\"Mary&#039;s Gone Crackers\" width=\"636\" height=\"340\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-24009\" srcset=\"https://www.mouseprint.org/wp-content/avert/marys-gone-crackers.jpg 636w, https://www.mouseprint.org/wp-content/avert/marys-gone-crackers-300x160.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 636px) 100vw, 636px\" /></p>\n<hr>\n<table>\n<th bgcolor=#E0E1CD>\n<font  size=\"+2\" color=#000000>Atkins Protein Bars</font>\n</th>\n</table>\n<p>Ace product investigator Richard G. found another shrinking product.  This time it is Atkins protein bars that seem to have gone on a diet. The old five pack is now a four pack.  Now if only losing 20% of your own weight was that simple&#8230;</p>\n<p><font color=red>*Mouse Print:</font></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://www.mouseprint.org/wp-content/avert/atkins-5-4mp.jpg\" alt=\"Atkins protein bars\" width=\"630\" height=\"375\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-24010\" srcset=\"https://www.mouseprint.org/wp-content/avert/atkins-5-4mp.jpg 630w, https://www.mouseprint.org/wp-content/avert/atkins-5-4mp-300x179.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 630px) 100vw, 630px\" /></p>\n<hr>\n<table>\n<th bgcolor=#E0E1CD>\n<font  size=\"+2\" color=#000000>Charmin Mega Rolls</font>\n</th>\n</table>\n<p>Continuing its downward trend, Charmin Ultra Soft mega size packages dropped 16 sheets from each roll, going from 224 sheets to just 208. Thanks to Brendan B. and Richard G. for this find.</p>\n<p><font color=red>*Mouse Print:</font></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://www.mouseprint.org/wp-content/avert/charmin-224-208mp.jpg\" alt=\"Charmin ultra soft\" width=\"700\" height=\"330\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-24011\" srcset=\"https://www.mouseprint.org/wp-content/avert/charmin-224-208mp.jpg 700w, https://www.mouseprint.org/wp-content/avert/charmin-224-208mp-300x141.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px\" /></p>\n<hr>\n<table>\n<th bgcolor=#E0E1CD>\n<font  size=\"+2\" color=#000000>Finish Ultimate Dishwashing Pods</font>\n</th>\n</table>\n<p>At a visit to Target, MrConsumer did a double-take when he saw identical size boxes of Finish dishwashing detergents but one had 76 pods and the other just 62.  And the larger package was cheaper!</p>\n<p><font color=red>*Mouse Print:</font></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://www.mouseprint.org/wp-content/avert/finish-ultimate-76-62mp.jpg\" alt=\"Finish dishwashing pods\" width=\"600\" height=\"401\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-24013\" srcset=\"https://www.mouseprint.org/wp-content/avert/finish-ultimate-76-62mp.jpg 600w, https://www.mouseprint.org/wp-content/avert/finish-ultimate-76-62mp-300x201.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" /></p>\n<hr>\n<table>\n<th bgcolor=#E0E1CD>\n<font  size=\"+2\" color=#000000>Scotts Turf Builder</font>\n</th>\n</table>\n<p>Shrinkflation is not limited to grocery products. Christopher D. discovered that fall weed and feed fertilizer from Scotts made a major change to his product. The bags decreased by three pounds making it only cover 4,000 square feet instead of the old 5,000 square feet. He also noticed that the percentage of nitrogen decreased. Even with all these decreases, the price did not go down at his store.</p>\n<p><font color=red>*Mouse Print:</font></p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://www.mouseprint.org/wp-content/avert/scotts-turfbuilder.jpg\" alt=\"Scotts Turfbuilder\" width=\"673\" height=\"580\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-24015\" srcset=\"https://www.mouseprint.org/wp-content/avert/scotts-turfbuilder.jpg 673w, https://www.mouseprint.org/wp-content/avert/scotts-turfbuilder-300x259.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 673px) 100vw, 673px\" /></p>\n<hr width=200>\n<p>If you find a product that has recently been downsized, please take a picture of the old and new version side-by-side if possible and send it to: Edgar(at symbol)MousePrint.org . Thanks.</p>\n",
   "protected": false
  },
  "excerpt": {
